# Dark Matter Illustrated Item Icons

When creating **new** items, pickups, inventory entries, blueprints, or any `ItemData` / recipe that shows an inventory icon:

## Mandatory

- **Every new item must ship a unique illustrated icon** in the isometric cream art style (warm off-white `#EDE9E4` glyph, thick dark-navy `#1C2A38` strokes, internal shading, dark-navy rounded tile, baked rarity ring per tier).
- **Do not** reuse third-party placeholders (`icons8`, `Survival Flat Icons`, legacy `Ammo_*.png`, Invector paths outside `_Project/Art/Icons/`).
- **Do not** wire Phase 2 bulk icon reassignment unless explicitly requested — create art for the **new** item only.

