Style anchor (prepend to every generation prompt):

> Dark Matter Genesis game item icon, exactly 512×512, isometric 2.5D illustrated. Cream off-white (#EDE9E4) with thick dark navy (#1C2A38) strokes and internal shadow/highlight shading — NOT flat silhouette. Dark navy rounded-square tile.

## Naming & folders

- **Filename:** `DM_<Category>_<Slug>_Icon.png`
- **Root:** `Assets/_Project/Art/Icons/<CategoryFolder>/`
- **Slug:** PascalCase words → `Snake_Case` (e.g. `Sci-Fi Pistol` → `Sci_Fi_Pistol`)
- **Blueprint icons:** `Blueprints/DM_Blueprint_<Slug>_Icon.png` — overlay from output item art; never redraw glyph separately

